- retries, replay/idempotency, uncertain writes, rollback and fail-closed paths where changed;
- Effect Clock/TestClock, timeout ordering, interruption and finalizers;
- schema/property negative oracles, AST lint fixtures, typecheck/build/source-resolution gates;
- direct observables versus false-green assertions;
- ENP-FND-043 through ENP-FND-050 recurrence proof, especially 401 lazy consumption, Layer defects/interruption, empty chunks, response cancellation, unclaimed expiry, header ordering and exactly-once body claims.

Return CLEAN with exact evidence inspected and residual non-claims, or actionable findings with file/line, invariant/requirement, failure mode and minimal correction/proof. Do not report style preferences or provider non-claims as defects.

